{"at":"2026-11-11T14:13:56.376Z","event":"workflow-result","results":[{"id":"DetectPotentialProblemsUseCase","success":true,"executed":true,"steps":["Bugbot dry-run completed after atomically completing 11 diff partitions with 1 accepted finding; no SCM mutations performed."],"payload":{"dryRun":true,"findings":[{"id":"frontend/src/presentation/domus-tasks.ts:creation-clears-draft-on-stale-receipt","title":"Match the creation receipt to the submitted request before clearing drafts","description":"After creating a task successfully, submit another creation with a whitespace-only title and a nonempty description. Local command validation rejects the title while retaining the previous successful creation outcome. This condition mistakes that old receipt for confirmation of the new submission and clears the description and other draft fields, even though the new task was never created.","file":"frontend/src/presentation/domus-tasks.ts","line":73,"endLine":75,"severity":"medium","confidence":0.96,"category":"correctness","evidence":"The numbered source listing confirms the receipt check at lines 73–75. The submit handler sets submittedDraft for every submission at line 101. decodeTaskIntent accepts string titles without content validation; TaskController.execute then rejects a title consisting of U+0020 through taskCommand/taskText and updates only notice, preserving the previous outcome. EntryRuntime.perform publishes the resulting view, so willUpdate sees the old committed task.create receipt and the matching newly submitted draft and erases it.","suggestion":"Associate draft clearing with confirmation of the particular submitted creation, such as its request key or a newly observed operation ID. Preserve the draft when local validation rejects the submission.","symbol":"DomusTasks.willUpdate","codeSnippet":"if (this.view?.outcome?.kind === 'receipt' && this.view.outcome.stage === 'committed' && this.view.outcome.action === 'task.create'\n        && this.submittedDraft === JSON.stringify([this.titleDraft, this.descriptionDraft, this.priorityDraft])) {\n      this.createOpen = false; this.titleDraft = ''; this.descriptionDraft = ''; this.priorityDraft = 'normal'; this.submittedDraft = null;","fingerprint":"fp-5278070c","semanticFingerprint":"sf-c01a4532"}],"overflowCount":0,"resolvedFindingIds":[],"findingStates":{"open":1,"reopened":0,"fixed":0,"obsolete":0,"dismissed":0,"verification-required":0,"unknown":0},"ruleSources":[],"contextCoverage":{"status":"complete","sources":[{"source":"selection","status":"complete","pagesFetched":1,"itemsFetched":1,"itemsRetained":1,"omittedItems":0,"truncatedItems":0,"limitReached":false},{"source":"issue-comments","status":"complete","pagesFetched":1,"itemsFetched":0,"itemsRetained":0,"omittedItems":0,"truncatedItems":0,"limitReached":false},{"source":"pull-request-comments","status":"complete","pagesFetched":1,"itemsFetched":0,"itemsRetained":0,"omittedItems":0,"truncatedItems":0,"limitReached":false},{"source":"review-threads","status":"complete","pagesFetched":1,"itemsFetched":0,"itemsRetained":0,"omittedItems":0,"truncatedItems":0,"limitReached":false},{"source":"diff","status":"complete","pagesFetched":1,"itemsFetched":71,"itemsRetained":71,"omittedItems":0,"truncatedItems":0,"limitReached":false},{"source":"previous-findings","status":"complete","pagesFetched":0,"itemsFetched":0,"itemsRetained":0,"omittedItems":0,"truncatedItems":0,"limitReached":false},{"source":"human-conversation","status":"complete","pagesFetched":0,"itemsFetched":0,"itemsRetained":0,"omittedItems":0,"truncatedItems":0,"limitReached":false},{"source":"rules","status":"complete","pagesFetched":0,"itemsFetched":0,"itemsRetained":0,"omittedItems":0,"truncatedItems":0,"limitReached":false}]},"bugbotShadowVerification":{"resolvedModel":"gpt-6.1-sol","provider":"codex","candidates":[{"status":"verdict","verdict":"confirmed","reason":"A reachable counterexample is submitting a whitespace-only title after a successful creation in the same scope. The form uses novalidate and checks only text length before recording submittedDraft and emitting create; the composition decoder accepts that title. Domain validation rejects whitespace-only required text, so TaskController.execute sets invalid_input and returns before run() clears the previous committed creation outcome. The actual caller publishes the resulting task view; taskWork does not refresh tasks, and the task component remains mounted. In willUpdate, invalid_input first opens the form, but the old committed task.create receipt then satisfies the clearing condition because submittedDraft matches the current draft. The component clears title, description and priority and closes the form, although this submission never produced a request or receipt. The draft-equality protection prevents clearing edited drafts, but does not establish that the receipt belongs to this submission.","missing":null,"citations":[{"kind":"git","sha":"57a8b4c6a9f52afb1ffc8e38275bcfd13575a3ae","path":"frontend/src/presentation/domus-tasks.ts","blob":"d26659bf1da83c36c2e0f455472fe0ed7b725cf8","first":62,"last":75,"receipt":"Rdef7d103d8d5987f8ffa7bc1","inChangedLines":false,"unchangedFile":true,"textSha256":"c53ed215f84c936f659f2e53372b665e582fb05308da5d77204f292695c43822"},{"kind":"git","sha":"57a8b4c6a9f52afb1ffc8e38275bcfd13575a3ae","path":"frontend/src/presentation/domus-tasks.ts","blob":"d26659bf1da83c36c2e0f455472fe0ed7b725cf8","first":92,"last":114,"receipt":"Rdef7d103d8d5987f8ffa7bc1","inChangedLines":false,"unchangedFile":true,"textSha256":"7ad1deee4d2dad38bf5a4c9967fd4cee94e5afdaba7c14f37ea0af96a78dcc15"},{"kind":"git","sha":"57a8b4c6a9f52afb1ffc8e38275bcfd13575a3ae","path":"frontend/src/domain/tasks.ts","blob":"31d97a0383ee9a0138c84ba016f47ab5dfa42f82","first":14,"last":19,"receipt":"Rb66d208b99e28c71cc319d34","inChangedLines":false,"unchangedFile":true,"textSha256":"2a6797fc21d0adc1dc445ff59a750ae4883816e92f39645d519c73a8133e6355"},{"kind":"git","sha":